        "text": "Page: Jaroslav Kvapil. Sentence: Jaroslav Kvapil (25 September 1868 in Chudenice, Kingdom of Bohemia – 10 January 1950 in Prague) was a Czech poet, playwright, and librettist.\nPage: Kingdom of Bohemia. Sentence: The Kingdom of Bohemia, sometimes in English literature referred to as the Czech Kingdom (Czech: \"České království\" ; German: \"Königreich Böhmen\" ; Latin: \"Regnum Bohemiae\" , sometimes Latin: \"Regnum Czechorum\" ), was a medieval and early modern monarchy in Central Europe, the predecessor of the modern Czech Republic.",
